    "The length byte Lc does not match the number of data bytes. Use CLA INS P1 P2, then optionally Lc and exactly Lc data bytes, then optionally Le. Extended-length APDUs are not supported here." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "The length byte Lc does not match the number of data bytes. Use CLA INS P1 P2, then optionally Lc and exactly Lc data bytes, then optionally Le. Extended-length APDUs are not supported here."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "长度字节 Lc 与数据字节数不符。格式为 CLA INS P1 P2，可选 Lc 加恰好 Lc 个数据字节，再可选 Le。此处不支持扩展长度 APDU。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
