    "Imported, not re-verified" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Imported, not re-verified"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "已导入，未重新验证"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This record was imported from a file. Passive Authentication is re-run on this device against the file's data groups; without a trusted CSCA certificate it can at best confirm the hashes and the SOD signature. A stored Active Authentication result is re-judged against that result; the challenge itself needs the chip and is not repeated. BAC, PACE and Chip Authentication need the physical chip, so they are not re-verified. Personal data is parsed from the file's data groups. Read the chip again to verify it fully." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "This record was imported from a file. Passive Authentication is re-run on this device against the file's data groups; without a trusted CSCA certificate it can at best confirm the hashes and the SOD signature. A stored Active Authentication result is re-judged against that result; the challenge itself needs the chip and is not repeated. BAC, PACE and Chip Authentication need the physical chip, so they are not re-verified. Personal data is parsed from the file's data groups. Read the chip again to verify it fully."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "此记录从文件导入。被动认证会在本设备上根据文件中的数据组重新运行；由于没有受信任的 CSCA 证书，最多只能确认哈希值和 SOD 签名。文件中保存的主动认证结果会依据该结果重新判定；挑战应答本身需要芯片，不会重做。BAC、PACE 和芯片认证需要实体芯片，因此未重新验证。个人信息由文件中的数据组解析得到。再次读取芯片可完整验证。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
